  "original_v4_343_gold": "the five released v4:343 gold modules under a pipeline_adc_two_stage wrapper; needs hierarchical instances with #() parameter overrides; generated only inside the repository (it reads benchmark/material/historyref)",
  "all": "every expectation assumes cross() events located within a few ps of the threshold crossing; the contract keeps vin within 0.25 mV and valid_i/rst crossings 100 ps away around every rising clk crossing, so the verdicts do not depend on that precision"
 },
